"}, "$:/themes/claude/stylish/readme": {"title": "$:/themes/claude/stylish/readme", "type": "text/vnd.tiddlywiki", "text": "! Stylish — Claude style

A calm, warm theme for TiddlyWiki inspired by the Claude.ai web app:
soft ivory surfaces, a gentle clay accent, flat low-contrast cards and
comfortable reading typography.

It ships with two matching palettes, ''Claude Light'' (warm ivory) and
''Claude Dark'' (warm near-black). The stylesheet reads its colours from
whichever palette is active, so it also works with any other palette.

!! How to use it

# Open the ''$:/ControlPanel'' (the gear icon in the sidebar).
# ''Appearance -> Theme'' -> choose ''Stylish''.
# ''Appearance -> Palette'' -> choose ''Claude Light'' or ''Claude Dark''.
# Save your wiki.

!! Make it yours

The clay accent is the palette's `primary` value (`#d97757` in light).
Edit the palette tiddlers to recolour links, tags, buttons and focus
rings in one place.
"}}}
